  "description": "Published-event capture for testing GM.Messaging consumers — assert \"this integration event was published\" without a real RabbitMQ broker. CapturingMessageBus stands in for Wolverine's IMessageBus and records every published/sent/scheduled message; PublishedMessages / Published<TEvent>() / ShouldHavePublished<TEvent>() make the assertions terse. Register with AddCapturingMessageBus() in a GmWebApplicationFactory override, or use the recorder directly in a unit test. Test-only (DevelopmentDependency).",
